# Production Environment Configuration
# This file is a TEMPLATE only. Real production values must be set in the
# Vercel dashboard (Project Settings → Environment Variables), NOT committed.
#
# .env.production should NEVER contain real secrets. Use .env.production.local
# (gitignored) for local preview against production-like config.
# NOTE: Do NOT set NODE_ENV here — Vite sets it automatically during build.

